--- arm 1: commit past its commit point, kill must refuse
kill_status	cant_cancel
mutation_entry_kept_during_pause	1
data_after_commit	1	101
mutation_entry_kept_after_commit	1
server_alive_after_arm1	1
--- arm 2: commit not yet at its commit point, kill must win
kill_status	waiting
commit_rejected	INVALID_TRANSACTION
data_after_kill	1	1
mutation_entry_removed	0
server_alive_after_arm2	1
